👉 https://www.wireshark.org

## 📌 Quick Summary
Wireshark is a network packet analyzer that allows users to capture and inspect traffic in real time. It is essential for troubleshooting, security analysis, and understanding network communication, making it a must-know tool for anyone entering cybersecurity.
